                    "text": "They probably called me in to keep order because I used to be a mercenary in the Eremites. I've done many... jobs for them."
                },
                {
                    "id": "641690204",
                    "speaker": "Shyam",
                    "text": "I am indeed up to the task, so if you need help, go ahead and ask."
                },
                {
                    "id": "641690205",
                    "speaker": "Shyam",
                    "text": "But if you want to cause any trouble on my watch, you'd better think twice."
                }
